    "html": "<p>An ideal gas is used to operate a Carnot engine. The energy transferred from the gas to the cold reservoir per cycle is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6000\\:\\textup{J}\"></span> and the energy absorbed by the gas from the hot reservoir per cycle is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10000\\:\\textup{J}\"></span>. The cold reservoir is kept at a constant temperature of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"27\\:{}^{\\circ}\\textup{C}\"></span> and the hot reservoir is kept at a constant temperature of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\\:{}^{\\circ}\\textup{C}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"45\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"68\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"230\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"480\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
